35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. Heavy items are out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The data is clear. People return for presence, not objects.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lab is empty. Two hundred pieces are waiting. We cannot clean anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. That is a disaster.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Transport ate a third of the installation budget. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
