44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, exactly. Local items avoid the courier and the crating fees.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I cannot support anything that needs heavy rigging or power.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The comment slips are unanimous. We need people in the room.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,We need a show that doesn't require conservation work.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need a show that doesn't rely on distant lenders.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need a show that doesn't bleed money on logistics.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am leaning towards something simple and local.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Presence is the key metric.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I am worried about the staffing, but local might work.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Local means no shipping cut-offs. That solves my problem.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Local means no transport costs. That solves mine.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
